=== Sub-family: a,b/2-power,(a^2-b^2) squarefree ===
  max sigma (a,c sqfree, odd-part b sqfree; m<=400): 3.5581582141173596749470424597256232296 at [309, 128] (13911 fibers)
  THEORY: if a,b,c=a^2-b^2 all squarefree (odd part), each n_p in {2,4} bounded.
  Then log|Dmin| <= 4 log a+4 log b+2 log c, log N=log(abc/...)~log a+log b+log c roughly.
  But ratio still ~ up to 4: NOT obviously <= small const without rad lower bound.

